graph TD
    J1[Part A]:::jumbled
    J2[Part B]:::jumbled
    J3[Part C]:::jumbled
    J4[Part D]:::jumbled
    S[Subject (S)]:::correct
    P[Predicate (P)]:::correct
    R[Object (R)]:::correct
    Q[Qualifier (Q)]:::correct
    
    J1 -->|Rearrange| S
    J2 -->|Rearrange| P
    J3 -->|Rearrange| R
    J4 -->|Rearrange| Q
    
    S --> P --> R --> Q
    
    classDef jumbled fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef correct fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;